
### Get all products
GET http://localhost:3001/api/products

### Get product by ID
GET http://localhost:3001/api/products/1

### Search products (example: search for 'headphones')
GET http://localhost:3001/api/products?search=headphones

### Get all enquiries (admin)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/enquiries
Authorization: Bearer secret-token

### Create new enquiry
POST http://localhost:3001/api/enquiries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": 1,
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "phone": "1234567890",
  "message": "I am interested in this product."
}

### Create another enquiry (example)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/enquiries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": 2,
  "name": "Alice Smith",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "message": "Can you provide more details about this product?"
}
